  "prompt": "How many web orders did Voltmarkt take in each ISO week at the turn of 2025 into 2026, by Amsterdam time? Use the orders table and keep the orders with channel 'web' whose Amsterdam date is from 2025-12-15 to 2026-01-04, both included. order_ts holds the time of the order in UTC: turn it into Amsterdam time first, then take the ISO week. Return three columns, in this order: iso_year, the year the ISO week belongs to, iso_week, the ISO week number, and orders, the number of web orders. Return one row for each ISO week. Any row order is fine.",
